OL,3,A'This is a turning point' Albertans say
OL,4,Aas they cast ballots on potential
OL,5,Aseparation from Canada
OL,6,
OL,7,FCanadians in Alberta are voting today
OL,8,Fon whether they want to remain a part
OL,9,Fof the country or move ahead with a
OL,10,Freferendum on independence - here's
OL,11,Fwhat else is on the ballot
OL,13,FMore than a million people voted early,
OL,14,FElections Alberta - the agency
OL,15,Foverseeing the vote - says,
OL,16,Frepresenting over 43% of the electorate
OL,18,F"I don't even consider myself to be
OL,19,FCanadian anymore," one voter tells the
OL,20,FBBC, while another calls today "a
OL,21,Fturning point in Canada's history"
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
